<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes secondary operations.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes secondary operations.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned both repurchase agreements whereby it had sought to drain 484 million pesos from the secondary market on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The repurchase agreements were placed as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    350 million     33 days   21.10 pct</p>
<p>    134 million	1 day    19.50 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( -- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
